title = 带远程 remote 的沙盒
cards = checkout commit-auto pull fetch push

[description]

这是一个带远程 remote 的沙盒！试试 pull、fetch 或 push！

怎样把标签 tag 和分支 branch 推送到远程 remote？又该怎样删除它们？

[setup yours]

echo "Line 1" > essay
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit"

git push -u friend main

[setup friend]

git checkout main
echo "Line 2" >> essay
git commit -am "Another line"
